<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.lei.strings ~ kui ~ swarm-lei-kui

`lares lei kui rite=<rite> branch=<name>` strings a lei: wide by default (`returns=<n>`), or `reach=head head=<h>` to pin one head. With no `after=` it follows the line's own tip (the first on an empty line); a named `after=` that is no tip refuses as forked, before any route or signature. More than twelve returns asks `yes=true`. `all=true` (push, kukulu) strings one lei for every open face under one route, each face's own record by its own hand at its own line's tip; a keep lei names one face and never rides `all=true`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ wide · pinned · every-face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`wide` params=`rite/kukulu branch/main returns/3 ~ a wide lei of three returns`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`pinned` params=`rite/push branch/main reach/head head/<commit> ~ pin one head`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`every-face` params=`rite/kukulu branch/main all/true ~ one lei per open face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ rite · branch · reach · returns · head · after · all · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rite` params=`takes/rite needs/required ~ the rite the lei grants: push, kukulu or keep`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the lei's branch`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`reach` params=`takes/reach ~ wide by default, or head to pin one head`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`returns` params=`takes/n ~ the returns the lei holds, from 1`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`head` params=`takes/commit ~ the head a head-reach pins`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`after` params=`takes/cid ~ the tip this lei follows; absent, the line's own tip`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`all` params=`~ string for every open face under one route`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose line this reads or strings, a whole count from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the row runs in the vessel, where the hand-only gate, the ward and the co-sign stand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

