!! refuses ~ usage · swarm-lei-forked · face-none-open · hand-act-only

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ a missing rite, branch or lei, a stray flag, or a malformed count`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`swarm-lei-forked` params=`~ the named after= names no tip; name the chain's tip`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-none-open` params=`~ no face stands open to string for`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-act-only` params=`~ an AI seat strung a lei; a person runs the line`>>
```

